@api = http://localhost:5000

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{api}}/health

### Log in as a seeded officer (every demo user's password is Passw0rd!)
# Other users: claimant1@ / claimant2@ / officer1..4@ / manager@claimdesk.test
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "officer1@claimdesk.test",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Who am I? Uses the token from the login request above
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### No token: 401 ProblemDetails
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me

### Wrong password: 401 ProblemDetails (same answer as an unknown email)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-wrong-password

{
  "email": "officer1@claimdesk.test",
  "password": "wrong"
}
